This bundle is a recorded read-only audit of a page from the W3C Web Accessibility Initiative's
"Before and After Demonstration" (BAD), https://www.w3.org/WAI/demos/bad/, a demonstration site
built by W3C to show accessibility barriers. The screenshot, the page source and the accessibility
tree in this bundle are copies of that page and are used under the W3C document licence.

